message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "k11 Appium QA MCP Server"
abstract: "MCP server and CI tool for self-healing Appium locators in native and hybrid Android and iOS apps: heals broken locators against the screen each test failed on, rewrites Python and Java Page Objects including AndroidFindBy and iOSXCUITFindBy annotations, verifies every change by re-running on the device, flags accessibility issues, and writes an audit report that k11 Release Gate reads as evidence."
